# Turning Special handling of INBOX off mid-session makes q and gi say there is no inbox, the Navigator lists INBOX among the projects, and the setting holds after a restart.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
Work:
END
keys g,
see Settings
keys /
type inbox
keys <Enter> <Space> <Esc>
keys q
status No INBOX project in the Navigator
restart
keys gi
status No INBOX project in the Navigator
keys <C-g>
see Projects
see INBOX
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
Work:
END
